{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00125",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.55,
      "end_seconds": 2.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Hello again. Come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.45,
      "end_seconds": 7.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right, hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.46,
      "end_seconds": 13.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.65,
      "end_seconds": 19.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.22,
      "end_seconds": 24.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Yeah, it's acne. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.87,
      "end_seconds": 28.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "What makes it worse, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.07,
      "end_seconds": 32.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Oily food and stress definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.16,
      "end_seconds": 39.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Hmm, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 40.03,
      "end_seconds": 44.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.44,
      "end_seconds": 52.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've had flare-ups before my period too, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 54.11,
      "end_seconds": 57.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.88,
      "end_seconds": 62.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.94,
      "end_seconds": 75.25,
      "duration_seconds": 12.31,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.58,
      "end_seconds": 78.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Any irregular periods, pregnancy or excess hair growth?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.36,
      "end_seconds": 90.69,
      "duration_seconds": 11.33,
      "text": "No, no irregular periods, no pregnancy, no excess hair growth. I did have dark marks after they heal at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.2,
      "end_seconds": 93.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Alright, any new face cream or scarring?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.76,
      "end_seconds": 98.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "I haven't had new face cream or scarring, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.3,
      "end_seconds": 100.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.45,
      "end_seconds": 103.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "No, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 105.33,
      "end_seconds": 109.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.5,
      "end_seconds": 115.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.16,
      "end_seconds": 122.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.44,
      "end_seconds": 125.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.05,
      "end_seconds": 127.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.8,
      "end_seconds": 130.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.45,
      "end_seconds": 134.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.55,
      "end_seconds": 135.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.68,
      "end_seconds": 149.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.09,
      "end_seconds": 158.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "Just a bypass operation, six years ago. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.41,
      "end_seconds": 163.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.17,
      "end_seconds": 167.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Codeine. I come out in... well, feeling very drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.99,
      "end_seconds": 171.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.85,
      "end_seconds": 174.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 175.67,
      "end_seconds": 182.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the glimepiride was 4 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.28,
      "end_seconds": 186.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.38,
      "end_seconds": 204.02,
      "duration_seconds": 16.64,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. It's hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. I'm on face wash, twice a day. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I used to take metformin, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.35,
      "end_seconds": 210.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "So, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.47,
      "end_seconds": 213.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "My grandmother had breast cancer. My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.35,
      "end_seconds": 218.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.51,
      "end_seconds": 222.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.5,
      "end_seconds": 226.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.96,
      "end_seconds": 229.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Diabetes, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.06,
      "end_seconds": 231.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.63,
      "end_seconds": 234.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "I've had eczema, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.39,
      "end_seconds": 236.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.61,
      "end_seconds": 239.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.98,
      "end_seconds": 244.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known eczema. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.43,
      "end_seconds": 249.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.08,
      "end_seconds": 250.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.25,
      "end_seconds": 267.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.54,
      "end_seconds": 274.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.17,
      "end_seconds": 277.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.32,
      "end_seconds": 302.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "There are red papules and a few pustules over the cheeks and chin, with some blackheads."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.1,
      "end_seconds": 318.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.33,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.3,
      "end_seconds": 322.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.63,
      "end_seconds": 336.11,
      "duration_seconds": 12.48,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with moderate acne. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out rosacea yet. I can't rule out a hormonal cause yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.8,
      "end_seconds": 343.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.36,
      "end_seconds": 357.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's moderate acne, and we'll watch how it goes. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had acne, and no new face cream."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.13,
      "end_seconds": 360.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "That's it, uh, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.11,
      "end_seconds": 365.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.49,
      "end_seconds": 366.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.24,
      "end_seconds": 401.12,
      "duration_seconds": 19.88,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I'm prescribing adapalene gel, at night, for eight weeks. It's for acne. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. It takes six to eight weeks to see the difference, so please don't give up in the first fortnight. Don't squeeze them, that's how the marks stay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.54,
      "end_seconds": 417.82,
      "duration_seconds": 15.28,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.33,
      "end_seconds": 420.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.14,
      "end_seconds": 433.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in eight weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 434.57,
      "end_seconds": 438.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 439.63,
      "end_seconds": 441.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.07,
      "end_seconds": 447.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Alright, can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 448.91,
      "end_seconds": 456.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "So, I take the adapalene gel, at night and come back in eight weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.3,
      "end_seconds": 462.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 463.67,
      "end_seconds": 467.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 468.28,
      "end_seconds": 469.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}